<title>USA: Sight Resource expects Q3 loss narrowed.</title>
<headline>Sight Resource expects Q3 loss narrowed.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sight Resource Corp said Thursday it expects its third quarter loss to have narrowed to $590,000, or $0.07 per share, compared to a loss of $1.1 million, or $0.21 per share, in the 1995 third quarter.</p>
<p>Revenues were expected to grow in the period to about $9.7 million compared to $5.2 million for the same period in the prior year.</p>
<p>Sight Resource, which provides eye care products and services, did not say when actual results were to be released.</p>
</text>
